DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:Deadline: Asian Cultural Council Individual Fellowship 2027 (up to 
 USD 35\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The Asian Cultural Council's Individual Fellowship supports sel
 f-directed exploration and cultural exchange experiences in a new or less 
 familiar environment\, fostering exchange between the United States and As
 ia and within Asia. SUPPORT: up to USD 35\,000 for a 1-to-6-month program 
 (minimum 30 days\; two or more months preferred)\; single or joint applica
 tions with up to 3 participants. ELIGIBILITY: citizens or permanent reside
 nts of ACC-eligible countries (the US and countries across Asia\, from Afg
 hanistan to Vietnam)\; age 21+\; at least five years of professional exper
 ience in an eligible discipline (architecture\, archaeology\, art history\
 , arts administration\, arts criticism\, conservation\, crafts\, curation\
 , dance\, ethnomusicology\, film\, literature\, museum studies\, music\, t
 heater\, visual art)\; English proficiency if traveling to the US\; no cou
 rsework or teaching during the fellowship. Grant activities must take plac
 e between 1 August 2027 and 31 December 2028. HOW TO APPLY: via the GoAppl
 y platform\; applications open 1 October 2026. Recommendation letters due 
 16 November 2026. No application fee. DEADLINE: 10 November 2026 at 9:59 A
 M ET.\n\nOrganisation: Asian Cultural Council\nLocation: Self-directed cul
 tural exchange between the US and Asia\, or within Asia. For citizens and 
 permanent residents of ACC-eligible countries (including the US).\nAward: 
 Up to USD 35\,000 for self-directed exploration and cultural exchange of 1
  to 6 months. Single or joint applications (up to 3 participants). No appl
 ication fee.\nDuration: 1 to 6 months (minimum 30 days\; 2 or more months 
 preferred)\, with grant activities between 1 August 2027 and 31 December 2
 028\n\nMore: https://www.asianculturalcouncil.org/grant-opportunities?utm_
 source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.asianculturalcouncil.org/grant-opportunities?utm_source=art
 ificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Self-directed cultural exchange between the US and Asia\, or withi
 n Asia. For citizens and permanent residents of ACC-eligible countries (in
 cluding the US).
